DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
27352::$$$message_0202_0000_0000$$$::"Oh, Emiya. Good night."[lr]::
27353::$$$message_0202_0000_0001$$$::"Good night, Tohsaka. Don't stay up too late."::
27354::$$$message_0202_0001_0000$$$::"...Wait, what was that?"[lr]::
27355::$$$message_0202_0001_0001$$$::I stop Tohsaka after passing by her.[lr]::
27356::$$$message_0202_0001_0002$$$::...I could've ignored it, but I'm curious.::
27357::$$$message_0202_0002_0000$$$::"What? Is there something wrong with me?"[lr]::
27358::$$$message_0202_0002_0001$$$::"Not you, but your gear.[lr]::
27359::$$$message_0202_0002_0002$$$::You're hiding something behind you."[lr]::
27360::$$$message_0202_0002_0003$$$::"It's not really any of your business... Here, want a look?"[lr]::
27361::$$$message_0202_0002_0004$$$::She shows me.[lr]::
27362::$$$message_0202_0002_0005$$$::Tohsaka is holding a strangely colored bottle and glass cup.::
27363::$$$message_0202_0003_0000$$$::"Are you going to drink that?"[lr]::
27364::$$$message_0202_0003_0001$$$::"What else would I do with it? It's a substitute for a nightcap."[lr]::
27365::$$$message_0202_0003_0002$$$::"Ah, I see. It must be that drink I've been hearing about that helps you sleep."[lr]::
27366::$$$message_0202_0003_0003$$$::How am I supposed to ignore that?::
27367::$$$message_0202_0004_0000$$$::"Am I just imagining it, or are you making an awful face?"[lr]::
27368::$$$message_0202_0004_0001$$$::"It isn't your imagination. It's your fault.[lr]::
27369::$$$message_0202_0004_0002$$$::Drinking before bed? Don't tell me that's alcoholic..."::
27370::$$$message_0202_0005_0000$$$::"You're making such a big deal out of it.[lr]::
27371::$$$message_0202_0005_0001$$$::Don't you drink some? Like when you can't sleep?"[lr]::
27372::$$$message_0202_0005_0002$$$::"When that happens, I just curl up under my covers. I don't usually have trouble falling asleep.[lr]::
27373::$$$message_0202_0005_0003$$$::So is it really alcoholic?"::
27374::$$$message_0202_0006_0000$$$::"...Of course you don't. You seem like the type to be fine even if you stay [font italic=true]dry[font italic=false] all year."[lr]::
27375::$$$message_0202_0006_0001$$$::I'm not sure if that was a compliment.[lr]::
27376::$$$message_0202_0006_0002$$$::She still hasn't answered my question.[lr]::
27377::$$$message_0202_0006_0003$$$::I start to pout, which finally gets her attention.::
27378::$$$message_0202_0007_0000$$$::"It isn't alcohol. Relax. Just some imported juice with a strong flavor.[lr]::
27379::$$$message_0202_0007_0001$$$::I use it to help trick myself into falling asleep."[lr]::
27380::$$$message_0202_0007_0002$$$::"Oh... I believe you for now, but don't drink too much."::
27381::$$$message_0202_0008_0000$$$::Fuji-nee's face comes to mind.[lr]::
27382::$$$message_0202_0008_0001$$$::She's a tiger, a big one...at least when it comes to holding her liquor.::
27383::$$$message_0202_0009_0000$$$::"Do you really believe me? Even if it was alcohol, I wouldn't drink like Ms. Fujimura does. [cacheimage storage=凛私服04c(遠)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服04c(遠) textoff=0]One of our family mottos is to drink but not get drunk."[lr]::
27384::$$$message_0202_0009_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
27385::$$$message_0202_0009_0002$$$::Tohsaka's family sure has some vulgar mottos.[lr]::
27386::$$$message_0202_0009_0003$$$::I'm sure it was a recent addition.::
27387::$$$message_0202_0010_0000$$$::"Calm down. Be confident and elegant in all things.[lr]::
27388::$$$message_0202_0010_0001$$$::I'd sooner die than disgrace myself by drinking myself sick."::
27389::$$$message_0202_0011_0000$$$::True... I can't imagine Tohsaka lying on the ground, groaning and wasted.[lr]::
27390::$$$message_0202_0011_0001$$$::She's an honor student who's shrewd in all things. She would take her own limits into account.[lr]::
27391::$$$message_0202_0011_0002$$$::...Though the bottle in her hands doesn't lend that impression.::
27392::$$$message_0202_0012_0000$$$::"...Sakura's the one you need to keep an eye on.[lr]::
27393::$$$message_0202_0012_0001$$$::That girl's got the potential to make Ms. Fujimura look like a scrub, someday. Rider feels like she could hold her drink, too. She's a snake, after all."[lr]::
27394::$$$message_0202_0012_0002$$$::"Tiger, snake... Is my house a zoo for alcoholic animals?[lr]::
27395::$$$message_0202_0012_0003$$$::So you were talking about liquor this whole time?"::
27396::$$$message_0202_0013_0000$$$::"...On that note, [cacheimage storage=凛私服09c(遠)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服09c(遠) textoff=0]you seem like you'd be a lightweight, Shirou."[lr]::
27397::$$$message_0202_0013_0001$$$::"I...don't think so. I can handle beer when it's in pork stews and stuff."[lr]::
27398::$$$message_0202_0013_0002$$$::"All the alcohol's evaporated from that."::
27399::$$$message_0202_0014_0000$$$::That's true. We'd all be in trouble otherwise.[lr]::
27400::$$$message_0202_0014_0001$$$::...Come to think of it, I have no idea if I can hold my liquor or not. I'm underage, after all.::
27401::$$$message_0202_0015_0000$$$::"...I'm underage, so it doesn't matter how much I can drink."[lr]::
27402::$$$message_0202_0015_0001$$$::"I'm just talking about the future.[lr]::
27403::$$$message_0202_0015_0002$$$::Hmm... I think you'll need to train yourself up."::
27404::$$$message_0202_0016_0000$$$::"Huh? Train for what?"[lr]::
27405::$$$message_0202_0016_0001$$$::"Liquor. Alcohol. Over there, they treat beer and wine like water. You'd better get used to it or you'll have a hard time."::
27406::$$$message_0202_0017_0000$$$::Over where? Oh, Europe.[lr]::
27407::$$$message_0202_0017_0001$$$::I've heard that before, but I don't think I need to practice just yet.::
27408::$$$message_0202_0018_0000$$$::"...Tohsaka, you don't seem like a drink[line len=2]"[lr]::
27409::$$$message_0202_0018_0001$$$::"What are you talking about? Who else is going to look after you when you get hammered and pass out?[lr]::
27410::$$$message_0202_0018_0002$$$::I don't want to end up the same way."::
27411::$$$message_0202_0019_0000$$$::...That does sound more likely than me looking after her.[lr]::
27412::$$$message_0202_0019_0001$$$::Tohsaka's holding a bottle of juice, but if you told me it was a bottle of brandy, I'd believe you. It looks very drinkable, too.::
27413::$$$message_0202_0020_0000$$$::"...Yeah. I'll do my best."[lr]::
27414::$$$message_0202_0020_0001$$$::"Effort doesn't decide whether you get drunk or not. At least half of it is genetic."[lr]::
27415::$$$message_0202_0020_0002$$$::"They do say a lot of Japanese people can't hold their alcohol.[lr]::
27416::$$$message_0202_0020_0003$$$::...Wait, then how am I supposed to train for it?"::
27417::$$$message_0202_0021_0000$$$::"You get used to it the more you drink.[lr]::
27418::$$$message_0202_0021_0001$$$::Besides, not knowing your own limits is the most dangerous thing of all."::
27419::$$$message_0202_0022_0000$$$::"...Hm."[lr]::
27420::$$$message_0202_0022_0001$$$::She has a point. If you try to run a long-distance course at high speed when you aren't used to running, you'll fall.[lr]::
27421::$$$message_0202_0022_0002$$$::Maybe alcohol is the same way. You could get carried away and go overboard before you know it...::
27422::$$$message_0202_0023_0000$$$::"Exactly.[lr]::
27423::$$$message_0202_0023_0001$$$::Well, you might as well join me, Shirou."[lr]::
27424::$$$message_0202_0023_0002$$$::"So that's how it works... No, wait. That's juice, right?"[lr]::
27425::$$$message_0202_0023_0003$$$::"Yeah. Juice. It's practice for before we come of age. You'll join me, won't you?"::
27426::$$$message_0202_0024_0000$$$::...Should I accept her invitation?[lr]::
27427::$$$message_0202_0024_0001$$$::She says the juice is practice for drinking hard liquor.[lr]::
27428::$$$message_0202_0024_0002$$$::I didn't think this would happen.::
27429::$$$message_0202_0025_0000$$$::"...What's with the faraway look?"[lr]::
27430::$$$message_0202_0025_0001$$$::"Well, I used to think that you were a perfect princess. Never in my dreams did I think you'd be talking about alcohol and inviting me for an evening drink."::
27431::$$$message_0202_0026_0000$$$::It doesn't sound that strange now.[lr]::
27432::$$$message_0202_0026_0001$$$::I guess I'm not that sentimental about my old feelings.::
27433::$$$message_0202_0027_0000$$$::"...You want to go back to how naïve you were back then?"[lr]::
27434::$$$message_0202_0027_0001$$$::"Not really. Okay. I'll join you... Do we need snacks or anything?"[lr]::
27435::$$$message_0202_0027_0002$$$::"I don't want to consume calories at this hour. I'm only going to have one cup, though."::
27436::$$$message_0202_0028_0000$$$::"I guess it wouldn't hurt." She changes her mind.[lr]::
27437::$$$message_0202_0028_0001$$$::Again, I'm curious where this bottle came from.::
27438::$$$message_0202_0029_0000$$$::"You didn't get that bottle here, right?"[lr]::
27439::$$$message_0202_0029_0001$$$::"Of course I did. Liquor is better drunk, not saved up."[lr]::
27440::$$$message_0202_0029_0002$$$::"...I guess it's fine. There's someone who keeps restocking them, after all."::
27441::$$$message_0202_0030_0000$$$::The Fujimura Group sure is generous. She always brings lots of imported goods and soft drinks over.[lr]::
27442::$$$message_0202_0030_0001$$$::I've tried a few of them, and I sometimes got dizzy, sometimes felt good, sometimes felt sick...::
27443::$$$message_0202_0031_0000$$$::"It's fine. Next time you come over, I'll make it up to you with something from the collection in my cellar. Then we'll be square."[lr]::
27444::$$$message_0202_0031_0001$$$::"What collection...? Okay, I'll get a glass."::
27445::$$$message_0202_0032_0000$$$::"One's enough."[lr]::
27446::$$$message_0202_0032_0001$$$::"Tohsaka, we'd be drinking from the same glass."[lr]::
27447::$$$message_0202_0032_0002$$$::We'd take turns drinking from the same glass... But still, the thought of passing the cup back and forth to Tohsaka is so...::
27448::$$$message_0202_0033_0000$$$::"...Oh, you. Learn to set the mood."[lr]::
27449::$$$message_0202_0033_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
27450::$$$message_0202_0033_0002$$$::The sudden advance catches me off guard.[lr]::
27451::$$$message_0202_0033_0003$$$::...I guess I'm the childish one.::
27452::$$$message_0202_0034_0000$$$::"...All right. But next time, bring two glasses."[lr]::
27453::$$$message_0202_0034_0001$$$::"Okay. Why don't we have it in my room?"::
927404::$$$message_9202_0016_0000$$$::"Huh? Train for what?"[r]::
�